catalog(1)

; Manual page for the example catalog tool.

# NAME

catalog - print labels for an in-memory file catalog

# SYNOPSIS

*catalog* [*-t*] [_file_...]

# DESCRIPTION

*catalog* prints one label per entry, such as "notes.md: 120 bytes".

# OPTIONS

*-t*
	Print the total size after the labels.

# SEE ALSO

*ls*(1)
